---
/** Where the Canadian audit-request form lands after a Netlify submission. Not indexed. */
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Request received | AuditYourHome" description="Your request reached us." indexable={false}>
  <div class="container thanks">
    <div class="page-hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Request received</p>
        <h1>Thanks. Your request reached us.</h1>
        <p class="lede measure">
          A person reads every request, usually within one business day, and introduces you to one registered service organization that serves
          your area. The reply comes from dave@clickshift.ca.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="card card-pad">
        <h2>While you wait</h2>
        <p>Find your last 12 months of energy bills and note the rooms that run cold, drafty or damp. Advisors use both.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card-pad">
        <h2>Rebates first</h2>
        <p>Many rebates need an evaluation before you start work. Check what your province offers before you sign a contract.</p>
        <p><a href="/ca/programs/">Rebates and programs</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card-pad">
        <h2>Plan the rest</h2>
        <p>The planner shows which tests your home is likely to need and what they cost where you live.</p>
        <p><a href="/ca/plan/">Open the planner</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="back"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/ca/">Back to the home page</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .thanks { padding-bottom: 48px; }
  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .steps h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .steps p { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted); }
  .back { margin-top: 22px; }
</style>
